@startuml
' Discivium proposed assignment-submission activity

title Discivium - Submit Assignment File Activity
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Student opens a published assignment;
:Student selects one PDF or DOCX file;
:Student submits the form;
:Authenticate request and read request.user;

if (Authenticated student?) then (yes)
  :Load assignment and course;
  if (Active enrollment exists?) then (yes)
    if (Assignment is published?) then (yes)
      :Validate file type and maximum size;
      if (File is valid?) then (yes)
        :Create Submission for request.user;
        :Store file reference and metadata;
        :Show successful submission result;
      else (no)
        :Return file-validation error;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Return safe unavailable response;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Return safe forbidden or not-found response;
  endif
else (no)
  :Redirect to sign-in or return authentication error;
endif

stop
@enduml
